&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best practices:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Always test the negative case — not just that authorized users can access things, but that unauthorized users cannot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test direct URL access — users may guess IDs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test after state changes — removing an assignee should immediately revoke access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use semantic selectors (&lt;code&gt;page.click(&#39;text=Submit&#39;)&lt;/code&gt;) over CSS class selectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;CI example&lt;span class=&#34;hx:absolute hx:-mt-20&#34; id=&#34;ci-example&#34;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
